**Foundation Models & Temporal**:
- AlphaEarth outperforms SatCLIP, Prithvi, Clay as frozen features (multiple benchmarks)
- L-TAE (Garnot & Landrieu, 2020): Lightweight temporal attention for satellite time series
- PASTIS/TimeSen2Crop: Standard benchmarks where L-TAE excels

**Multi-Task Learning**:
- Kendall et al. (2018): Uncertainty-weighted multi-task loss
- Research finding: Simple loss weighting (fixed or homoscedastic) often matches complex methods
- Recommendation: Start with fixed weights, upgrade to learned uncertainty weights if needed

